{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-19","kind":"proposition","title":"直线切圆圆内作切线之垂线则圆心必在垂线之内","englishTitle":"If a straight line touch a circle, and from the point of contact a straight line be drawn at right angles to the tangent, the centre of the circle will be on the straight line so drawn.","book":3,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.19/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","contentId":"euclid-3-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2919bf1d4faeeeb0a699a91e22700af4e7191eee857441c75c9acc540252d143","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-19.statement","euclid-3-19.construction.1","euclid-3-19.proof.1","euclid-3-19.proof.2","euclid-3-19.proof.3","euclid-3-19.proof.4","euclid-3-19.proof.5","euclid-3-19.conclusion","euclid-3-19.historical.1","euclid-3-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef7caa1baccd31567094e64bbc8349ebc71e9742bc1104185f989181351243ce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line touch a circle, and from the point of contact a straight line be drawn at right angles to the tangent, the centre of the circle will be on the straight line so drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线触碰一个圆,从接触点直角至正切线绘制一条直线,则圆的中心将位于如此绘制的直线上。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"直线切圜圜内作切线之垂线则圜心必在垂线之内"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果直线在圆内被截并作切线的垂线，则圆心必须在垂线内。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9f52ab357f0c30eb3525a6ab468af16fd0f12683d7c33a8f6c24555a92bce86","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a straight line DE touch the circle ABC at the point C, and from C let CA be drawn at right angles to DE; I say that the centre of the circle is on AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线DE触摸C点的ABC圆,从C触摸CA线,划出直角至DE线;我说圆的中心是AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb0a83927aa22deb192ec4ba6d2e54bc1eb9c884a9d5bd195ed1a54aa0169515","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For suppose it is not, but, if possible, let F be the centre, and let CF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设不是,但如果可能,让F成为中心,让CF连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c20acc0517237418c3838baad68b3c3f2309d4284116cf8178c0abe16c8c09eb","citations":["euclid-3-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since a straight line DE touches the circle ABC, and FC has been joined from the centre to the point of contact, FC is perpendicular to DE; [[III. 18](/principles/euclid-3-18)] therefore the angle FCE is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于一条直线DE直线触及ABC圆,而且FC线已从中心连接到接触点,FC直线直线直线至DE;因此,角度FCE是正确的。 [[III. 18](/principles/euclid-3-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90f3788ea760a320cfeb1d296304523f62cc2e279683a44cf1ac96f5634833d8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ACE is also right; therefore the angle FCE is equal to the angle ACE, the less to the greater: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度ACE也是对的,因此角度FCE等于角度ACE,数量小到数量大:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5d33f60c358c78209ee1dd0e00f64e5ae23d9e0bcb0be3b8496065586c75368","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore F is not the centre of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,F不是ABC圆的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84b913f553a059488070cbd61a9179b97ed18bf5ca2e37cdf7660d135c0aa087","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is any other point except a point on AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,除了AC点之外,这两个点都不存在。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"06afd0fbd228937cae2ca2f7c49e807c1ab1baf9dc125c7610b6b1123fcda12a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"直线切圜圜内作切线之垂线则圜心必在垂线之内解曰甲乙线切丙丁戊圜于丙圜内作戊丙为甲乙之垂线题言圜心在戊丙线内论曰如云不然心在于已令从已作己丙直线即己丙亦为甲乙之垂线〈本篇十八〉而已丙甲与戊丙甲等为直角是全与其分等矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线与圆相切，那么如果在圆内画一条垂线，则圆心必须在该垂线上。解释如下：甲乙 与圆 丙丁戊 相切的直线，丙 在圆内画出。戊丙 是 甲乙 的垂线。命题解释：圆心位于直线 戊丙 内。证明如下：如果不是，则圆心已经由直线 己丙 得出，即 己丙 也是 甲乙 的垂线。〈本篇十八〉 只是 的垂线。丙甲 和 戊丙甲 是直角，因此它们互相相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-19.source","contentId":"euclid-3-19","revisionId":"euclid-3-19@raw-2919bf1d4faeeeb0","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"093aa360aba970b09cfa80fb7878094d780d8e125c6e58b4844481fb8b1960de","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.19/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.19\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-19:euclid-3-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-19.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.19/","sourceLabel":"III. 18"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-3-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-32.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"III. 19"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-19:euclid-3-18:explicit","id":"euclid-3-18","book":3,"number":18,"kind":"proposition","title":"直线切圆从圆心作直线至切界必为切线之垂线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-3-19:explicit","id":"euclid-3-32","book":3,"number":32,"kind":"proposition","title":"弦切角定理","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
